#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:323
msgid "WP-Cron"
msgstr "WP-Cron"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:325
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:345
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Désactivé"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:325
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Activé"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:326
msgid "Enabled (recommended)"
msgstr "Activé (recommandé)"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:328
msgid ""
"WP-Cron is disabled. Email queue processing and scheduled tasks may not work "
"properly unless you have a real cron job configured."
msgstr ""
"WP-Cron est désactivé. Le traitement de la file d'attente des e-mails et les "
"tâches planifiées peuvent ne pas fonctionner correctement à moins d'avoir "
"configuré une tâche cron réelle."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:329
msgid "WP-Cron is enabled and working."
msgstr "WP-Cron est activé et fonctionne."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:330
msgid "Set up a real cron job or enable WP-Cron in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Configurez une tâche cron réelle ou activez WP-Cron dans wp-config.php"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:343
msgid "PHP mail() Function"
msgstr "Fonction PHP mail()"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:345
msgid "Available"
msgstr "Disponible"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:346
msgid "Available (for fallback)"
msgstr "Disponible (en secours)"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:348
msgid ""
"PHP mail() is disabled. This is fine if using SMTP, but there is no fallback "
"option."
msgstr ""
"PHP mail() est désactivé. C'est acceptable si vous utilisez SMTP, mais il "
"n'y a pas d'option de secours."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:349
msgid "PHP mail() is available as a fallback option."
msgstr "PHP mail() est disponible comme option de secours."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:357
msgid "OpenSSL Extension"
msgstr "Extension OpenSSL"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:359
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:374
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:388
msgid "Not loaded"
msgstr "Non chargé"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:360
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:375
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:389
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:440
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Requis"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:362
msgid "OpenSSL is available for secure SMTP connections."
msgstr "OpenSSL est disponible pour les connexions SMTP sécurisées."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:363
msgid "OpenSSL is required for TLS/SSL encrypted SMTP connections."
msgstr "OpenSSL est requis pour les connexions SMTP chiffrées TLS/SSL."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:364
msgid "Contact your hosting provider to enable OpenSSL."
msgstr "Contactez votre hébergeur pour activer OpenSSL."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:372
msgid "cURL Extension"
msgstr "Extension cURL"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:374
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:388
msgid "Loaded"
msgstr "Chargé"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:377
msgid "cURL is available for API-based email providers."
msgstr "cURL est disponible pour les fournisseurs d'e-mails basés sur API."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:378
msgid ""
"cURL is required for API-based email providers (SendGrid, Mailgun, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"cURL est requis pour les fournisseurs d'e-mails basés sur API (SendGrid, "
"Mailgun, etc.)."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:379
msgid "Contact your hosting provider to enable cURL."
msgstr "Contactez votre hébergeur pour activer cURL."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:386
msgid "JSON Extension"
msgstr "Extension JSON"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:391
msgid "JSON extension is available."
msgstr "L'extension JSON est disponible."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:392
msgid "JSON extension is required for processing API responses."
msgstr "L'extension JSON est requise pour traiter les réponses API."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:393
msgid "Contact your hosting provider to enable JSON."
msgstr "Contactez votre hébergeur pour activer JSON."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:401
msgid "PHP Memory Limit"
msgstr "Limite de mémoire PHP"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:408
#, php-format
msgid "Memory limit of %s is sufficient."
msgstr "La limite de mémoire de %s est suffisante."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:413
#, php-format
msgid "Memory limit of %s may be too low for processing large email queues."
msgstr ""
"La limite de mémoire de %s peut être trop faible pour traiter de grandes "
"files d'attente d'e-mails."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:416
msgid "Increase memory_limit in php.ini or contact your hosting provider."
msgstr "Augmentez memory_limit dans php.ini ou contactez votre hébergeur."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:423
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Temps d'exécution maximum"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:425 includes/strings.php:956
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Illimité"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:428
msgid "Max execution time is sufficient for email processing."
msgstr ""
"Le temps d'exécution maximum est suffisant pour le traitement des e-mails."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:429
msgid "Max execution time may be too short for large email batches."
msgstr ""
"Le temps d'exécution maximum peut être trop court pour de gros volumes d'e-"
"mails."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:430
msgid "Increase max_execution_time in php.ini."
msgstr "Augmentez max_execution_time dans php.ini."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:437
msgid "Outbound Connections"
msgstr "Connexions sortantes"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:439
msgid "Working"
msgstr "Fonctionnel"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:439
msgid "May be blocked"
msgstr "Peut être bloqué"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:442
msgid "Server can make outbound connections for SMTP and API calls."
msgstr ""
"Le serveur peut établir des connexions sortantes pour SMTP et les appels API."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:443
msgid ""
"Outbound connections may be blocked. SMTP port access could be restricted."
msgstr ""
"Les connexions sortantes peuvent être bloquées. L'accès aux ports SMTP peut "
"être restreint."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:444
msgid ""
"Contact your hosting provider to ensure SMTP ports (25, 465, 587) are not "
"blocked."
msgstr ""
"Contactez votre hébergeur pour vous assurer que les ports SMTP (25, 465, "
"587) ne sont pas bloqués."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:452
msgid "Temp Directory"
msgstr "Répertoire temporaire"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:454
#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:455
msgid "Writable"
msgstr "Accessible en écriture"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:454
msgid "Not writable"
msgstr "Non accessible en écriture"

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:457
msgid "Temp directory is writable for attachment processing."
msgstr ""
"Le répertoire temporaire est accessible en écriture pour le traitement des "
"pièces jointes."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:458
msgid ""
"Temp directory is not writable. Email attachments may not work properly."
msgstr ""
"Le répertoire temporaire n'est pas accessible en écriture. Les pièces "
"jointes peuvent ne pas fonctionner correctement."

#: includes/class-conflict-detector.php:459
msgid "Ensure the temp directory has write permissions."
msgstr ""
"Assurez-vous que le répertoire temporaire dispose des permissions d'écriture."

