#: includes/strings.php:50
msgid ""
"Authority Mailer helps you send WordPress emails reliably through "
"professional SMTP providers. No more emails landing in spam! This quick "
"setup wizard will guide you through connecting your preferred email service "
"in just a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Authority Mailer vous aide à envoyer vos e-mails WordPress de manière fiable "
"grâce à des fournisseurs SMTP professionnels. Fini les e-mails qui arrivent "
"dans les spams ! Cet assistant vous guidera en quelques minutes pour "
"connecter votre service d'e-mail préféré."

#: includes/strings.php:51
msgid "✨ What happens next?"
msgstr "✨ Et maintenant ?"

#: includes/strings.php:52
msgid ""
"<strong>Choose your email provider</strong> from our list of 17+ supported "
"services"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Choisissez votre fournisseur d'e-mail</strong> parmi notre liste de "
"plus de 17 services pris en charge"

#: includes/strings.php:53
msgid "<strong>Enter your credentials</strong> (usually just an API key)"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Saisissez vos identifiants</strong> (généralement une simple clé API)"

#: includes/strings.php:54
msgid "<strong>Send a test email</strong> to verify everything works"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Envoyez un e-mail de test</strong> pour vérifier que tout fonctionne"

#: includes/strings.php:55
msgid ""
"<strong>You're done!</strong> All WordPress emails will now be sent reliably"
msgstr ""
"<strong>C'est terminé !</strong> Tous vos e-mails WordPress seront désormais "
"envoyés de manière fiable"

